5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried we’ll pick a plan that makes us stop talking to each other. What matters most to you all right now?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the daily smell and mess. I want to know what living beside each option actually feels like, morning by morning.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I need to quantify the time cost. I want to know exactly how many hours this arrangement will demand from each of us, both initially and ongoing.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji I agree! But also, one house has had this at their gate for years. I want to make sure we don't just sign something that leaves it that way.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, I share your worry. But before we choose, we must know the true cost. Who is paying for this mess, and how much does it really take?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, that’s a good point. @Asuka, do you think we can figure out the time costs before we even pick a plan?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, that is a very sensible question. Perhaps we should look at the ward’s records to see what similar arrangements have cost in time and money.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, not yet. We need the ward’s filing requirements and the supervised morning timings to calculate the actual hours.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I think we should also check the measurements of the five frontages. If one house is tiny, moving the bins there might be impossible!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, you are right. We must see the measurements. @Asuka, your time data is vital. Let us gather these facts before we judge.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that’s a great idea. If the space is too small, moving it there is impossible. @Asuka, do you think we can get the ward’s filing requirements and the supervised morning timings?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, yes, those details are crucial. I would also like to visit the station block’s bin house to see how their setup actually feels to live beside.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, I will take the ward filing requirements and the supervised mornings. @Shizue, your visit is wise. @Rin, please check the frontage measurements.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I’ll check the frontage measurements! @Shizue, I hope the bin house isn’t too smelly. I’m ready to look into things now!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, your diligence is admirable. I will examine the block ledger and the ward subsidy. We must understand the financial burden before we commit to any path.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, thanks for taking those. @Shizue, I hope the bin house visit goes well. I’ll look into the complaint log and the residents’ meeting statements to see what’s really bothering people.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that sounds very thorough. I will visit the station block’s bin house and read their meeting minutes to see how their arrangement truly feels day to day.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will review the ward filing requirements and the supervised morning timings. This data is essential to calculate the precise time burden for each household.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the frontage measurements and the ward complaint log! I want to see if the tiny house can fit the bins and who is complaining the most.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will review the block ledger and the ward subsidy. We must understand the financial reality before we commit to any path.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
