35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, the complaint log shows eleven of fourteen entries came from the gate household. That explains the silence.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that is a heavy burden for one family. I visited the station block’s bin house; the smell is worse than the open pile, and they argue constantly.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, the filing data confirms a permanent build takes four months. Supervised mornings average fifty minutes, totaling twenty per household annually.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, eleven complaints from one house? That’s not fair! @Shizue, if the bin house smells worse, why build one?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, twenty hours is manageable. @Shizue, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen yearly in waste. We must stop the bleeding before building anything.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, it is unfair, but the meeting notes show nobody wants to enforce rules. @Servas, thirty-four thousand yen is real. We need a plan that stops the mess without making us enemies.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. The station block’s experience shows that even a nice structure brings new arguments. We must choose a path that keeps our peace, not just our bins tidy.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, twenty hours is the minimum. The four-month filing delay is the real cost. We must account for that administrative burden before committing.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, if nobody wants to enforce rules, how do we stop the mess? @Asuka, twenty hours is a lot for me!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, twenty hours is a small price for peace. @Asuka, the subsidy covers much of the build, but the ledger shows our daily waste is the true drain.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, twenty hours is just over two hours a month. We can share it. @Asuka, the filing delay is real, but we can start now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, you are right. We must share the load. @Rin, do not worry. We will find a way that is gentle on everyone’s time and spirit.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, four months is not a delay, it is a commitment. @Rin, twenty hours is a fact, not a burden. We must accept the administrative reality before proceeding.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, twenty hours is still a lot for a nine-year-old! @Kenji, if we share it, does that mean I only do a few?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, a few hours is a blessing. @Asuka, the subsidy covers ninety thousand, but the ledger’s thirty-four thousand yearly drain remains. We must balance both.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, yes, just a few. @Servas, the money is real, but the silence is worse. We need a plan that keeps us talking, not just paying.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, you are right. We must keep our doors open. @Rin, do not worry about the hours; we will share the work gently.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the hours are fixed. @Kenji, the silence is a symptom, not the cause. We must address the root structural failure first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, I’m glad we’re sharing the work! But @Asuka, if one house is tiny, how can we move the bins there?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the measurements show one frontage is too narrow. We must respect those limits. @Asuka, the ledger proves our current waste is costly. Let us choose wisely.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
